       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REFMOD.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ACCNO        PIC X(12) VALUE "SBIN00012345".
       01  WS-BRANCH       PIC X(4).
       01  WS-NUMBER       PIC X(8).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE WS-ACCNO(1:4)  TO WS-BRANCH
           MOVE WS-ACCNO(5:8)  TO WS-NUMBER
           DISPLAY "21 - REFERENCE MODIFICATION"
           DISPLAY "ACCOUNT : " WS-ACCNO
           DISPLAY "BRANCH  : " WS-BRANCH
           DISPLAY "NUMBER  : " WS-NUMBER
           STOP RUN.